      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm running into a really weird issue with our records. i updated the A records like an hour ago, and it's such a mess. some users can hit the new site, but then other users are suddenly getting sent to dead links or the old IP, and it's almost like the data is just vanishing or being redirected by some unseen force. it's making the whole network feel super unstable and elusive. why is the propagation behaving so inconsistently like this?",
